WEBVTT

00:00:01.260 --> 00:00:02.810
My name is Taiki Kudou.

00:00:03.170 --> 00:00:06.600
I was taken to this mysterious 
place called the Digital World,

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:08.230
where I met Shoutmon

00:00:08.230 --> 00:00:11.320
and the other creatures of 
this world, called Digimon.

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:16.260
<b>Team Bagra</b>

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:16.260
<b>Enemy?                              The battle begins!                              Enemy</b>

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:16.260
<b>Team ?       Team Kiriha                          Team Taiki</b>

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:16.260
Mysterious                        Rival
Girl

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:16.260
<b>Enemy?
Ally?</b>

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:16.260
Protagonist

00:00:11.740 --> 00:00:14.530
This world is having a lot of trouble

00:00:14.530 --> 00:00:16.260
with the attacking Bagra Army.

00:00:17.530 --> 00:00:20.500
Our adventure in the Sand 
Zone led us to some ruins,

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:22.700
where we were approved by Pharaohmon

00:00:22.700 --> 00:00:24.970
and got the Code Crown.

00:00:25.470 --> 00:00:33.980
<b>Taiki, Warrior of the Goddess!</b>

00:00:27.260 --> 00:00:29.820
Taiki, Warrior of the Goddess!

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:36.370
Tail!

00:00:39.530 --> 00:00:40.170
That's...

00:00:52.430 --> 00:00:55.370
To think someone could be an 
even match against Blastmon...

00:01:00.620 --> 00:01:01.740
My Xros Loader!

00:01:02.600 --> 00:01:03.510
Watch out!

00:01:05.690 --> 00:01:07.960
We can't DigiXros!

00:01:13.890 --> 00:01:16.540
That's the guy who attacked me before!

00:01:17.890 --> 00:01:18.960
He's gone!

00:01:18.960 --> 00:01:21.880
That's Baalmon, 
a Reaper in the Bagra Army.

00:01:21.880 --> 00:01:24.280
Once he gets you in his 
sights, you're dead.

00:01:24.280 --> 00:01:24.990
What?!

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:26.580
A Reaper?

00:01:26.580 --> 00:01:27.900
Not again!

00:01:29.220 --> 00:01:31.300
This is bad! There's a dead end ahead!

00:01:32.110 --> 00:01:33.400
We're cornered!

00:01:33.840 --> 00:01:36.310
I guess we've fallen right into his trap.

00:01:38.380 --> 00:01:39.840
<i>Xros Loader...</i>

00:01:39.840 --> 00:01:41.110
If I just had you...

00:01:41.110 --> 00:01:42.150
Taiki Kudou!

00:01:49.850 --> 00:01:51.560
A statue of a Digimon goddess?

00:01:54.780 --> 00:01:56.760
The attacks have stopped.

00:02:00.450 --> 00:02:03.000
Take your Xros Loader, boy.

00:02:03.800 --> 00:02:05.120
Why?

00:02:05.120 --> 00:02:07.770
Weren't you just trying 
to kill us with your gun?

00:02:08.710 --> 00:02:12.260
I now have a reason to 
fight you fair and square.

00:02:14.810 --> 00:02:15.400
Taiki...

00:02:19.720 --> 00:02:21.200
DigiXros!

00:02:21.200 --> 00:02:22.840
DigiXros!

00:02:24.140 --> 00:02:26.900
Shoutmon X4!

00:02:34.400 --> 00:02:38.050
Burning Star Crusher!

00:02:43.040 --> 00:02:44.200
Wow...

00:02:44.200 --> 00:02:45.730
And he's supposed to be a Reaper...

00:02:47.820 --> 00:02:50.350
He's a gallant warrior!

00:02:51.650 --> 00:02:55.890
What? Baalmon still hasn't 
gotten rid of them?

00:02:55.890 --> 00:02:58.260
Correct. It seems to be 
taking longer than expected.

00:02:58.260 --> 00:02:59.620
Honestly...

00:02:59.620 --> 00:03:01.540
What a sad excuse for a Reaper.

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:11.100
Two-arm block!

00:03:11.100 --> 00:03:12.340
Death Divider!

00:03:12.340 --> 00:03:14.570
Quiet, irritating fly!

00:03:14.570 --> 00:03:16.970
Give it up already!

00:03:16.970 --> 00:03:20.000
Premium Diamond Tail!

00:03:24.350 --> 00:03:24.870
What?!

00:03:30.290 --> 00:03:31.590
Look out!

00:03:31.590 --> 00:03:32.990
Taiki!

00:03:34.490 --> 00:03:36.510
Those are Blastmon's crystal bullets!

00:03:36.510 --> 00:03:36.980
Run!

00:03:37.560 --> 00:03:38.910
Brother! We've got trouble!

00:03:39.480 --> 00:03:41.430
Akari! We've gotta run for now!

00:03:57.410 --> 00:03:59.950
Where am I?

00:04:00.850 --> 00:04:02.620
Guys, can you hear me?

00:04:04.180 --> 00:04:05.870
I guess not...

00:04:09.940 --> 00:04:11.260
The statue from before...

00:04:15.220 --> 00:04:17.460
It fell down here, too?

00:04:19.320 --> 00:04:23.840
But, wow, what a noble-looking 
goddess statue.

00:04:43.520 --> 00:04:45.800
The light of the Warrior...

00:04:47.540 --> 00:04:48.580
Y-You!

00:04:55.530 --> 00:04:57.840
The Goddess has approved of you.

00:04:58.260 --> 00:05:00.680
You've become a Warrior of the Goddess.

00:05:01.580 --> 00:05:03.380
This Zone was once governed

00:05:03.380 --> 00:05:07.060
by an order known as the 
Warriors of the Goddess.

00:05:07.060 --> 00:05:08.650
Warriors of the Goddess?

00:05:08.650 --> 00:05:12.690
Those chosen must have courage 
and justice in their hearts.

00:05:12.920 --> 00:05:17.750
They are chosen warriors who 
regard Angemon as their mentor.

00:05:20.380 --> 00:05:22.430
They were the greatest of warriors,

00:05:22.710 --> 00:05:26.500
bound tightly by friendship and trust.

00:05:32.320 --> 00:05:36.210
I never thought a new 
Warrior would be born.

00:05:36.210 --> 00:05:37.960
I've been chosen?

00:05:40.350 --> 00:05:42.510
It's a bad idea to stay here.

00:05:43.660 --> 00:05:44.550
Come.

00:05:56.770 --> 00:05:58.970
My beautiful crystals...

00:05:59.200 --> 00:06:01.200
They changed because of 
that attack you used.

00:06:01.200 --> 00:06:02.200
Yes.

00:06:02.200 --> 00:06:04.120
Eat these for now.

00:06:05.300 --> 00:06:07.410
Gulp!

00:06:07.410 --> 00:06:10.420
Not enough! Just eating won't help!

00:06:10.760 --> 00:06:13.740
I'm going back to headquarters 
for a crystal bath!

00:06:13.740 --> 00:06:15.590
But the fight isn't over!

00:06:16.670 --> 00:06:21.290
I cannot fight with such 
a lackluster body!

00:06:25.100 --> 00:06:28.900
Looks like that nuisance 
took off somewhere.

00:06:28.900 --> 00:06:33.640
I hear Taiki has obtained this 
area's Code Crown, though.

00:06:34.280 --> 00:06:37.330
I see. He got me this time.

00:06:37.330 --> 00:06:39.740
Then I have no reason to stay here.

00:06:50.620 --> 00:06:51.770
Water...

00:06:51.770 --> 00:06:53.800
This underground channel 
once supplied the entire

00:06:53.800 --> 00:06:55.590
Sand Zone with water.

00:06:56.060 --> 00:06:58.330
You sure know a lot about this place.

00:07:00.200 --> 00:07:03.740
Could it be that you were 
once a Warrior, too?

00:07:03.970 --> 00:07:05.290
No.

00:07:05.290 --> 00:07:07.570
Don't concern yourself with me.

00:07:07.570 --> 00:07:11.890
When you say that, I just can't 
turn my back on you...

00:07:15.580 --> 00:07:20.420
Taiki!

00:07:17.470 --> 00:07:20.420
Taiki, where are you?

00:07:20.670 --> 00:07:22.130
So hot...

00:07:22.130 --> 00:07:24.090
Hey, Taiki!

00:07:25.190 --> 00:07:27.630
It couldn't be... Is that a mirage?

00:07:28.010 --> 00:07:31.000
Yeah! He's not over here, Brother!

00:07:31.400 --> 00:07:33.100
Yeah! Not here, either!

00:07:33.100 --> 00:07:34.000
Yeah!

00:07:34.240 --> 00:07:35.150
Not here, either!

00:07:35.670 --> 00:07:36.720
Okay, boys!

00:07:37.180 --> 00:07:38.440
Next we check over there!

00:07:38.440 --> 00:07:39.880
Yeah!

00:07:41.170 --> 00:07:43.170
Jeez, they startled me...

00:07:43.440 --> 00:07:45.640
Well, let's check over there.

00:07:57.060 --> 00:07:58.600
Guys?

00:08:00.560 --> 00:08:04.210
The monsters born in the 
Digital realm: Digimon.

00:08:04.210 --> 00:08:06.700
They may be made up of data,

00:08:06.700 --> 00:08:11.600
but they're our precious friends 
who cry, laugh, and fight for us.

00:08:11.600 --> 00:08:13.670
Join us in our world of adventure

00:08:13.990 --> 00:08:17.240
as we gather lots more teammates!

00:08:17.240 --> 00:08:18.310
DigiXros!

00:09:50.530 --> 00:09:52.360
I don't know how you can walk through

00:09:52.360 --> 00:09:54.320
such a complex place without getting lost.

00:09:55.570 --> 00:09:59.230
This place really is interesting, 
with such a huge city underground.

00:10:10.370 --> 00:10:12.250
Oh, man!

00:10:13.770 --> 00:10:15.390
What were those Digimon?

00:10:16.160 --> 00:10:19.760
I get it! This must be their town!

00:10:19.760 --> 00:10:21.770
They were KoDokugumon,

00:10:21.770 --> 00:10:24.790
and this is not their town.

00:10:25.830 --> 00:10:28.110
This town is called Sandoria.

00:10:28.110 --> 00:10:31.590
It was once the most prosperous 
city in the Sand Zone.

00:10:32.320 --> 00:10:34.650
Until tragedy befell it...

00:10:35.280 --> 00:10:36.150
Tragedy?

00:10:36.400 --> 00:10:39.590
It led to the fall of the city.

00:10:39.590 --> 00:10:42.030
Eventually it was swallowed by the sands,

00:10:42.030 --> 00:10:46.120
and became infested with 
KoDokugumon searching for prey.

00:10:51.190 --> 00:10:53.560
This place really was your...

00:11:01.780 --> 00:11:04.040
The damage here is really bad.

00:11:06.890 --> 00:11:08.950
It's completely blocked.

00:11:09.710 --> 00:11:11.280
I'll take care of that.

00:11:11.280 --> 00:11:12.280
Wait a minute!

00:11:13.130 --> 00:11:14.850
If you fire your gun here,

00:11:14.850 --> 00:11:17.420
the whole channel might cave in.

00:11:20.120 --> 00:11:22.140
Let me try.

00:11:22.540 --> 00:11:24.030
Legendary Digimon,

00:11:24.030 --> 00:11:25.800
<b>Guilmon</b>

00:11:24.030 --> 00:11:25.800
<b>Rock 'n Roll Breaker</b>

00:11:25.310 --> 00:11:27.170
lend us your strength!

00:11:27.170 --> 00:11:28.000
Guilmon!

00:11:31.970 --> 00:11:34.670
Rock 'n Roll Breaker, activate!

00:11:56.820 --> 00:11:58.200
Is this...

00:11:58.200 --> 00:12:00.250
battle ruins?

00:12:07.640 --> 00:12:10.200
The tragedy of the 
Warriors of the Goddess.

00:12:12.340 --> 00:12:15.880
This is where it happened.

00:12:16.950 --> 00:12:21.230
The Warriors of the Goddess 
were wiped out here.

00:12:26.060 --> 00:12:27.460
The one who killed them...

00:12:30.070 --> 00:12:30.930
was me.

00:12:32.340 --> 00:12:36.230
War had broken out 
throughout the Digital World,

00:12:36.230 --> 00:12:39.550
posing a threat to the Sand Zone as well.

00:12:40.050 --> 00:12:41.600
Sandoria was protected by

00:12:41.600 --> 00:12:45.470
the Digimon known as the 
Warriors of the Goddess,

00:12:45.470 --> 00:12:47.910
so it continued to enjoy 
peace and prosperity.

00:12:55.470 --> 00:12:58.670
All right, that's enough for today.

00:12:58.670 --> 00:13:00.490
Please, give me one more round!

00:13:00.490 --> 00:13:02.160
Give it a rest.

00:13:02.160 --> 00:13:04.130
Sir Angemon is tired.

00:13:04.130 --> 00:13:06.830
Why are you taking this 
so seriously, Baalmon?

00:13:06.830 --> 00:13:08.800
But... But...

00:13:09.590 --> 00:13:11.200
It is time to pray.

00:13:29.870 --> 00:13:33.030
This is where you've been, Baalmon?

00:13:33.730 --> 00:13:36.260
Have you completed your 
prayers to the Goddess?

00:13:36.570 --> 00:13:39.310
The Goddess doesn't hear my prayers!

00:13:40.060 --> 00:13:41.520
I'm...

00:13:41.520 --> 00:13:44.520
I'm not even recognized as 
a Warrior of the Goddess!

00:13:45.140 --> 00:13:46.640
Baalmon...

00:13:46.640 --> 00:13:48.310
I've done as you said,

00:13:48.310 --> 00:13:52.670
and followed my training to become 
a Warrior ever since I was a child!

00:13:53.100 --> 00:13:54.210
Yet...

00:13:54.210 --> 00:13:56.240
When I reach out my hand,

00:13:56.240 --> 00:13:58.550
the statue of the Goddess doesn't glow.

00:13:58.820 --> 00:14:01.950
She's never once smiled at me.

00:14:01.950 --> 00:14:04.580
I've tried so hard to become strong.

00:14:04.580 --> 00:14:07.660
I'm the strongest one here next to you!

00:14:07.660 --> 00:14:08.940
But still...

00:14:09.970 --> 00:14:11.270
But still...

00:14:13.120 --> 00:14:16.060
I can't be a Warrior of the Goddess.

00:14:19.930 --> 00:14:24.350
The Goddess never smiled 
at me after that, either.

00:14:26.190 --> 00:14:28.720
Boy with the red Xros Loader...

00:14:29.250 --> 00:14:32.210
The Goddess smiled at you.

00:14:32.210 --> 00:14:36.150
That may have been a message 
telling me not to kill you.

00:14:36.590 --> 00:14:41.060
I felt as though the Goddess had 
spoken to me for the first time.

00:14:41.910 --> 00:14:43.430
Baalmon...

00:14:46.400 --> 00:14:48.640
I annihilated my companions,

00:14:48.640 --> 00:14:51.200
the Warriors of the Goddess.

00:14:51.540 --> 00:14:56.120
It was terrifying... like a nightmare.

00:14:56.670 --> 00:15:00.880
Someone cursed the Warriors 
so they would kill each other

00:15:00.880 --> 00:15:03.060
in reaction to a mark 
placed on their foreheads,

00:15:03.060 --> 00:15:04.620
and a strange sound.

00:15:13.890 --> 00:15:18.250
The fear I felt when the Warriors, 
my companions, attacked me...

00:15:18.820 --> 00:15:21.180
My body moved of its own will,

00:15:21.180 --> 00:15:24.040
and the next thing I knew, 
the Warriors were all dead.

00:15:24.040 --> 00:15:27.510
So someone set a trap?

00:15:27.510 --> 00:15:28.910
Yes.

00:15:28.910 --> 00:15:32.080
I work for the Bagra Army now,

00:15:32.080 --> 00:15:36.380
but it's only for the sake of 
finding the one who set that trap.

00:15:38.680 --> 00:15:40.400
There's the surface.

00:15:40.400 --> 00:15:41.970
How do we get up there?

00:15:50.060 --> 00:15:51.790
Thanks, Baalmon.

00:15:51.790 --> 00:15:53.150
I've gotta look for the others.

00:15:55.760 --> 00:15:57.100
Shoutmon, are you...

00:15:59.470 --> 00:16:00.740
Sh-Shoutmon?

00:16:00.740 --> 00:16:02.170
That mark...

00:16:10.550 --> 00:16:12.150
Did you see their foreheads?

00:16:12.150 --> 00:16:13.480
Was that...

00:16:13.720 --> 00:16:14.750
Yes.

00:16:14.750 --> 00:16:16.590
The same mark that was used back then.

00:16:16.880 --> 00:16:18.190
Taiki!

00:16:20.860 --> 00:16:23.810
What are you doing?! He's a Reaper!

00:16:25.760 --> 00:16:28.340
It's okay. I guarantee it.

00:16:28.340 --> 00:16:30.070
We can trust Baalmon.

00:16:30.070 --> 00:16:31.200
What?!

00:16:31.200 --> 00:16:33.470
Taiki, something's wrong with the Digimon.

00:16:33.470 --> 00:16:36.470
They all just fell over, and then 
there was a strange sound...

00:16:36.470 --> 00:16:38.310
Then they attacked us!

00:16:38.540 --> 00:16:41.380
Someone is manipulating 
Shoutmon and the others.

00:16:41.380 --> 00:16:42.750
What?!

00:16:46.050 --> 00:16:47.290
Stop that!

00:16:50.820 --> 00:16:52.920
All of you, get in the Xros Loader!

00:17:03.200 --> 00:17:04.340
It's not working...

00:17:06.690 --> 00:17:07.410
Stop!

00:17:07.760 --> 00:17:08.640
What?!

00:17:08.640 --> 00:17:09.440
Don't attack them!

00:17:09.440 --> 00:17:11.910
Fool! If we don't kill 
them, they'll kill us!

00:17:13.510 --> 00:17:15.810
I can't attack my friends!

00:17:18.120 --> 00:17:18.780
I...

00:17:18.780 --> 00:17:21.090
I'll never give up!

00:17:23.700 --> 00:17:25.220
That laugh...

00:17:28.980 --> 00:17:31.780
Isn't this fun, Baalmon?

00:17:31.780 --> 00:17:34.670
It's the cruelest show 
this world has ever seen.

00:17:38.070 --> 00:17:39.400
Foolish child.

00:17:39.400 --> 00:17:41.370
You might as well let 
your friends kill you.

00:17:43.450 --> 00:17:46.810
Those bewitched by Ebemon's attack

00:17:46.810 --> 00:17:48.650
see everyone around them as enemies,

00:17:48.650 --> 00:17:50.370
and end up killing each other.

00:17:51.850 --> 00:17:54.250
What a delightful show!

00:17:54.250 --> 00:17:56.690
Now, kill to your hearts' content!

00:18:10.140 --> 00:18:11.700
Sir Angemon?

00:18:16.000 --> 00:18:17.590
Sir Angemon...

00:18:18.940 --> 00:18:21.610
Sir Angemon!

00:18:29.750 --> 00:18:32.090
What are you doing, Baalmon?

00:18:32.090 --> 00:18:34.230
I've been searching for you, Lilithmon.

00:18:34.230 --> 00:18:37.860
You're the one who used Ebemon 
to plunge the Sand Zone

00:18:37.860 --> 00:18:40.770
and my companions into ruin!

00:18:41.170 --> 00:18:44.800
Do you actually believe you're 
a survivor of those warriors?

00:18:44.800 --> 00:18:49.060
I will avenge the the Warriors 
who were caught and died

00:18:49.060 --> 00:18:50.270
in your cowardly trap!

00:18:50.520 --> 00:18:51.440
Baalmon...

00:18:51.440 --> 00:18:53.210
What's going on, Taiki Kudou?

00:18:53.490 --> 00:18:58.290
I thought it was strange that 
you followed me so persistently.

00:18:58.290 --> 00:19:00.210
So that explains it.

00:19:01.190 --> 00:19:03.220
It's too bad for you, though.

00:19:03.220 --> 00:19:04.020
What?

00:19:12.630 --> 00:19:16.500
Because you're going to die here.

00:19:16.500 --> 00:19:17.150
Baalmon!

00:19:19.900 --> 00:19:21.870
Shoutmon! Baalmon is...

00:19:22.240 --> 00:19:23.840
Huh? Wh-What's going on?

00:19:23.840 --> 00:19:24.880
I'll explain later!

00:19:24.880 --> 00:19:25.980
We've gotta save Baalmon!

00:19:25.980 --> 00:19:27.080
What?!

00:19:27.080 --> 00:19:28.300
Please, Shoutmon!

00:19:30.660 --> 00:19:34.190
All right! If you want 
to save him, we're in!

00:19:36.220 --> 00:19:37.960
Shoutmon!

00:19:37.960 --> 00:19:39.210
Oh yeah!

00:19:39.420 --> 00:19:40.490
Ballistamon!

00:19:41.830 --> 00:19:43.130
Dorulumon!

00:19:44.560 --> 00:19:45.560
Starmons!

00:19:45.560 --> 00:19:46.990
Yes!

00:19:47.770 --> 00:19:49.210
DigiXros!

00:19:49.690 --> 00:19:51.350
DigiXros!

00:19:53.380 --> 00:19:56.280
Shoutmon X4!

00:20:00.140 --> 00:20:01.950
Brain Rapture!

00:20:01.950 --> 00:20:03.100
Run in a zigzag!

00:20:04.790 --> 00:20:06.870
Aim for the gun, X4!

00:20:07.190 --> 00:20:08.070
Got it!

00:20:16.260 --> 00:20:18.460
Planet Destroyer!

00:20:22.570 --> 00:20:24.300
Fire your vulcans, X4!

00:20:34.570 --> 00:20:35.650
What?!

00:20:37.150 --> 00:20:39.020
I won't let you kill Baalmon!

00:20:39.020 --> 00:20:41.320
You're in my way.

00:20:41.320 --> 00:20:44.000
But no matter. You're too late, anyway.

00:20:44.520 --> 00:20:45.630
Baalmon?

00:20:48.030 --> 00:20:49.660
Baalmon!

00:20:52.460 --> 00:20:54.670
<b>To Be Continued</b>

00:20:54.680 --> 00:20:58.200
<b>Digimon Data Collection</b>

00:20:55.170 --> 00:20:58.200
Digimon Data Collection!

00:20:58.200 --> 00:21:02.140
<b>Listen to the Digimon's melody!</b>

00:20:58.720 --> 00:21:02.140
Listen to the melody of 
this Digimon I caught!

